  "correction": "The self-normalised 'own dial' ((C-C0).(Cfin-C0)/|Cfin-C0|^2) is NOT the order parameter: it reaches 1.000 at the final checkpoint by construction, and the benign and inoculated arms reach own-dial 0.75-1.00 with 0% EM. Earlier rows that quoted own-direction dials (medical 0.684, finance 0.679, sports 0.685) happened to agree only because those are all strong EM organisms whose endpoint displacements are large and mutually convergent (cos 0.86-0.91 at layer 23).",
